  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 06. Email change — verify new address
  File       : change-email-verify.liquid
  Class      : Auth — transactional, no unsubscribe
  Trigger    : Change confirmed from the old address (sent to the NEW address)
  Replaces   : change-email-verify.liquid (MFR)

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Verify your new email address
    2. {{ user.name.first }}, one last step to switch your email
    3. Is this your new MyHealthOpinions address?

  PREHEADER
    The last step of your email change. Until you verify, the old address stays in use.

  PLAIN-TEXT PART
    dist/text/change-email-verify.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.

  Generated from src/content/templates.js + src/design/ — edit those and run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.
===============================================================================
